      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MESSENGER.\nMy Lord Protector, ’tis his highness’ pleasure\nYou do prepare to ride unto Saint Albans,\nWhereas the King and Queen do mean to hawk.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
