    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23493",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HUME.\nJesus preserve your royal majesty!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23493/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23493/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 40,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2286307,
        "end": 2286377,
        "line": 83694,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap13/p@23493",
        "anchor": "sceneI_13.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "HUME.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23567",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ELEANOR.\nWhat sayst thou? Majesty! I am but grace.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23567/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23567/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 50,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2286381,
        "end": 2286461,
        "line": 83699,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap13/p@23567",
        "anchor": "sceneI_13.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ELEANOR.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23651",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HUME.\nBut, by the grace of God, and Hume’s advice,\nYour grace’s title shall be multiplied.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23651/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23651/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 50,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23651/line-3",
          "start": 51,
          "end": 90,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2286465,
        "end": 2286590,
        "line": 83704,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap13/p@23651",
        "anchor": "sceneI_13.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "HUME.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23780",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ELEANOR.\nWhat sayst thou, man? Hast thou as yet conferred\nWith Margery Jourdain, the cunning witch,\nWith Roger Bolingbroke, the conjurer?\nAnd will they undertake to do me good?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23780/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23780/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 57,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23780/line-3",
          "start": 58,
          "end": 99,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23780/line-4",
          "start": 100,
          "end": 137,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@23780/line-5",
          "start": 138,
          "end": 176,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2286594,
        "end": 2286815,
        "line": 83710,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap13/p@23780",
        "anchor": "sceneI_13.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ELEANOR.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@24005",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HUME.\nThis they have promised, to show your highness\nA spirit raised from depth of underground,\nThat shall make answer to such questions\nAs by your Grace shall be propounded him.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@24005/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@24005/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@24005/line-3",
          "start": 53,
          "end": 95,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@24005/line-4",
          "start": 96,
          "end": 136,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@24005/line-5",
          "start": 137,
          "end": 178,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2286819,
        "end": 2287042,
        "line": 83718,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap13/p@24005",
        "anchor": "sceneI_13.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "HUME.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@24232",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ELEANOR.\nIt is enough, I’ll think upon the questions.\nWhen from Saint Albans we do make return,\nWe’ll see these things effected to the full.\nHere, Hume, take this reward; make merry, man,\nWith thy confederates in this weighty cause.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@24232/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@24232/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 53,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@24232/line-3",
          "start": 54,
          "end": 95,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@24232/line-4",
          "start": 96,
          "end": 140,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneI_13.2/p@24232/line-5",
          "start": 141,
          "end": 187,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
